gDZ(){return"When completing, Dowit lets you take a photo on Android and iPhone or pick a saved image. It first shows a preview and only completes the event after you accept it. Each occurrence of a routine keeps its own proof."},
gE8(){return"Notes"},
gE6(){return"Notes hold what does not fit in the title or tasks: an address, a link, a short reminder. It is free optional text and does not block the Complete button."},
gE7(){return'\u2022 You write them in the form, in the "Notes" field above the schedule.\n\u2022 They appear on the event screen, in the "Notes" block.\n\u2022 In the main list, a notes icon appears next to the title only when there are notes.\n\u2022 Templates also store their notes.'},
