gDq(){return'\u2022 Requirements are added in the form, in the "Requires" section: tap + and pick the events.\n\u2022 There can be several: all of them must be complete.\n\u2022 If a requirement is deleted, it counts as met.\n\u2022 No loops: if A requires B, B cannot require A.'},
